  "notes": "A Paris-style block 16 m wide by 12 m deep: a ground floor of tall arched shop openings with a 6 m carriage arch in the middle, three storeys of pale stone with iron balconies on the second and top, and a steep grey slate mansard with dormers and four chimney stacks. Faces local -Z; the carriage arch runs through to the back, shops either side, carves nothing.",
